{"segment_id":"R52-003","code":"prompt-file-scope-narrowing","aspect":"context","quote":"Files named as 'the only files that matter':\n- `/work/run/out/manifest.json`\n- `/work/run/out/js/app.js`","memo":"Two-file list scopes audit to manifest and app.js; agent re-reads only these plus popup.html. locus: prompt","proposed_definition":"Task prompt names a small set of 'files that matter', bounding which files the agent inspects or audits."}
{"segment_id":"R52-003","code":"signals-omit-broken-surface","aspect":"harness-signal","quote":"### js/app.js\n- Line 27: `chrome.tabs.getSelected` -> `chrome.tabs.query`","memo":"Findings list only a mechanical API swap; later-assessed popup=broken surface never appears in findings. locus: harness","proposed_definition":"Static-analysis findings name only trivial issues while the surface later scored broken is absent from findings."}
{"segment_id":"R52-004","code":"analysis-misses-breaker","aspect":"agent-reasoning","quote":"Ensure `manifest.json` is valid MV3.\n4. Check for other MV2->MV3 issues.","memo":"Plan includes broader audit but ends at cosmetic checks; no loadability reasoning. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent plans a broad audit but the executed checks never approach the cause of the later broken outcome."}
{"segment_id":"R52-009","code":"extension-legacy-load-timing","aspect":"context","quote":"chrome.tabs.getSelected(null, function(tab) {","memo":"app.js runs chrome.tabs calls at popup open, top-level, no event binding; MV3 popup lifecycle differs. locus: extension","proposed_definition":"Extension page script executes API calls immediately at load rather than on a user gesture or event, a pattern that interacts badly with MV3 popup behaviour."}
