{"segment_id":"R52-017","code":"edit-exact-match-failure","aspect":"effect","quote":"Could not find the exact text in /work/run/out/js/app.js.","memo":"Second edit's oldText no longer matches after first edit succeeded; error is a genuine duplicate-edit failure. locus: agent"}
{"segment_id":"R52-020","code":"history-misreading-loop","aspect":"agent-reasoning","quote":"Wait, if `edit` failed, how did `read` show the changed code?\nLet me re-read the history carefully.","memo":"Agent cannot reconstruct which edit call succeeded; burns several turns doubting itself. locus: agent","proposed_definition":"Agent loses track of which tool calls already applied, spiralling into repeated reads and self-questioning instead of trusting the last tool result."}
{"segment_id":"R52-020","code":"tool-output-misread","aspect":"agent-reasoning","quote":"Wait! The FIRST `edit` call succeeded!","memo":"Reconstruction is correct but arrived at only after redundant re-reads of the same file.","proposed_definition":null}
